{"id":"n83996-1-7","stage":2,"title":"하양 · 白色","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83996-1-7-1","ko":"회색을 만들어야 하는데 하양이 없네.","zh":"我需要调灰色，可是没有白色颜料啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회색을","meaning":"灰色","explanation":"회색：灰色；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회색","audio":"/audio/d1b93538300e4bba352d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73242","senseId":"1","lemma":"회색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회색을","audio":"/audio/89c9ebbfc53515c86497.mp3"}},{"text":"만들어야","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만들어야","audio":"/audio/b546c6ab1ae77becce2f.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"하양이","meaning":"白色，白","explanation":"하양：白色，白；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"하양","audio":"/audio/fca1dc3d3fe82f62fa71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83996","senseId":"1","lemma":"하양","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하양이","audio":"/audio/68b0f87108354af5276a.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d1b93538300e4bba","term":"회색","zh":"灰色","audio":"/audio/d1b93538300e4bba352d.mp3","entryId":"73242","definition":"黑色和白色